Statement of modifications (AGPL §5(a) / ONLYOFFICE §7)
-------------------------------------------------------
Modified by: Sharekey
First modified: 2026 (see git history of this repository for dates)

Summary of modifications applied on top of upstream ONLYOFFICE:

  1. DocumentServer removed. The editor is repackaged as a static site
     that boots without an OnlyOffice DocumentServer. The missing
     server-side boot steps are synthesized at runtime by
     `wrapper/v1/editor-stubs.js` (~12 "cascade" patches).
  2. SDK reslimmed. The shipped `sdk-all-min.js` is rebuilt from upstream
     sdkjs sources by `wrapper/build/bundle.js` (slim editor-mode bundle).
  3. sdkjs source patch: `__plainFonts` XOR-skip in
     common/Drawings/Externals.js — see
     `wrapper/sdkjs-patches/0001-externals-plainfonts.patch`.
  4. Font set reduced + substituted (Liberation/Carlito/Caladea/DejaVu/
     OpenSymbol) via a hand-written `AllFonts.js` manifest.
  5. Cross-origin postMessage host integration + custom edit.html boot,
     view/edit lock UX, and connection/conflict overlays (Sharekey glue).
  6. web-apps deploy trimmed (help/mobile/embed/locales) for size.

The exact, buildable corresponding source for the AGPL-covered parts is
this repository plus the pinned upstream refs in `upstream-pins/`; the
procedure to reproduce it is in `wrapper/REGENERATE.md`.


